# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Client / project-confidential plant data — DO NOT PUBLISH
#
# This repo is public and deploys to GitHub Pages. Anything naming the real
# facility, its instrument tags, trip setpoints, SIL ratings, F&G zones or
# FDS document numbers stays local.
#
# The demo runs on synthetic data in src/plant/. Real project data lives in
# these ignored paths and is loaded locally only.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

